text:
Last week, Hurricane Helene’s path of destruction tore through much of the Southeast, including our home state of Georgia.

To aid those affected by the devastation of the hurricane, Delta will contribute an additional $500,000 to our longstanding partner, 
@RedCross.

Our commitment to innovation isn't just about building a better company - it's about connecting people to a broader, bigger world with endless opportunities.

We're proud to earn a Top 10 spot on 
@FastCompany's Most Innovative Companies in Travel 🏆
